HOW THE ATTRIBUTION IS IMPLEMENTED
----------------------------------

Single source: src/core/brand.ts. It is rendered on every menu (preview,
full-screen view, exported files, print), in the editor footer, in server logs,
CLI output and emails. `npm run check:attribution` (run by `npm test` and CI)
fails if any of it is removed.


